      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另外还把她难以开口的事\n全都问出来并帮忙解决。\n感情更加深厚的两人，朝“日本沙土德比”迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "633d8a0bfbb48b1ecae6e12018cbf190e398526b96e16ce8ffeaeb95ce016968",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
