    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b64b59b705c8df11170cb5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏本以为能借由“东京大赏典”，\n让想要重新振作的人们看到希望。\n然而──",
      "source_fingerprint": "30ca7f118a0f780ceb4c046c1962e716f862167d3fe2e26975d0950a1e864a05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100403.json",
      "json_path": [
