    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb74d482b814fb61727e9ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──没能成功。询问过感想后发现，\n只靠踏实地跑步，\n也只能稍稍振奋大家的精神……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8ade21cd56a8308e3dc6cad1d445ee4b2c185e22d47bf369629fd598266b28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100403.json",
      "json_path": [
