    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380e96f144781ed96a02c56f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏因为过于逞强造成反弹，\n身体似乎变得不听使唤。\n要想恢复，朝目标迈进的动力是很重要的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "95faaa25ae4f177206536a47dbede5aaf7e575ede5fabb2477da277c7d9da6a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
