      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b870a3c6cbe416e31ffb2c13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她“靠跑步成为想重新振作的人们的希望”\n这个目标已一步步实现。这时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e6cee65aa6c70bfdb1a32a48c868169207f7555079ebfb56702f341cf6b5bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab13c9748a7ebd4c78804361",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6c8b85d13217635e508047",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰宣布将前往迪拜挑战国际GⅠ。\n想再和她一战的目标变得无法实现。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a1ee5e74731238ee85092f9f9a9c2748025c4dcf8ea165fb558bad2e1cad4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db100b4fce25efb23dc1d58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c13910dda04fd311fd29cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对即将到来的“柏纪念”，\n恢复状况不理想，也失去了对奔跑的强烈意愿。\n奇锐骏的未来究竟会怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa7d62f830cbba12cfb688bf3d4ac8c93bc192b40291fdb4d04727d2a8f32851",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:378404b4209344bde654bf56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "渐渐落下的夕阳",
      "source_fingerprint": "502727e263456c4a9465f085265332263131658a26332e73348301fe37e5d9bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec5851aade24a9d0a273f35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d50723e6b6b4d50fe9bc55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏决定要引退。\n她向训练员展示最后一次的奔跑──\n北港火山却在这时前来与她竞争。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a61ebdc39bfffa93b614caf3b4d99ae741cc0294090d5da288d387dae0aab805",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c68b3e223a13c9c0d1a8eec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e86643a173d6c6652dba3f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示看过奇锐骏的“川崎纪念”后醒悟了。\n所以希望能向她讨教，\n并要求在比赛中决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ff4b0f5473e9572fcb2f7b1f51d5d693ff535ab9fe3d476771f285d2fbe4c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995d18cc79bbfa8029296eb1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60bf92d84914778c383a76db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏觉得仅此一次也无不可，\n答应和她在“JBC经典赛”决胜负。\n新世代的热血暂时拦下了引退之心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a60dad12a9f3b5dc2a2ee93400e9b6082d60af428f1e1a3ba28b30ffd7122ed6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1100/storytimeline_501100405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef27ed8c778405745510d312",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙滩上的最后一跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "7523bb2d4694896adf32fa4b1f262198c6eff5c750d6706ea958e6eaefb8f22a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
